---
_type: Concept
title: 'Nominal typing structural typing'
journey: fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/index.td")
status: 'learning'
---

A type system where ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/type-compatibility.td")} is determined by **explicit declarations** (class names, inheritance hierarchy), not structure - `class A` and `class B` are different even if identical in shape.
